      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>임업경영</keyword>
        <keyword>분석</keyword>
        <keyword>지표이다</keyword>
        <keyword>내용</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>1</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>임업소득 임업소득률</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답가안</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 임업경영 · 임업경영 분석 지표
정답은 ①이다. 임업소득은 임업조수익에서 임업경영비를 뺀 값이고, 임업소득률은 임업조수익에 대한 임업소득의 비율(× 100)이다. 임가소득은 임업소득에 농업·겸업 소득 등을 더한 것이고, 자본장비도는 임업 종사자 1인당 고정자본액이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>임업소득 임업소득률</choice_text>
          <commentary>임업소득, 임업소득률이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>임가소득 자본장비도</choice_text>
          <commentary>둘 다 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>임업소득 자본장비도</choice_text>
          <commentary>(나)가 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>임가소득 임업소득률</choice_text>
          <commentary>(가)가 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
